# What the install job installs to run the tests on the Pythons that are still supported, 3.11
# and up (ci.yml). The lock holds one version of each package: that is what Dependabot needs
# to maintain it. The Pythons past their end of life use frozen/ (see the .in there).
#
# When a Python reaches its end of life, it moves to frozen/: raise the --python-version this
# lock is compiled with in update.sh, and list that Python in the matrix of ci.yml.
pytest
pytest-cov
